{"ticker":{"symbol":"003300.KS","name":"한일홀딩스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":17170.0,"change_pct":0.008813160987074076,"market_cap":529375887360.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.05824111822947001,"week52_low":15250.0,"week52_high":23800.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Building Materials","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":22,"website":"https://www.hanil.com","business_summary":"Hanil Holdings Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells construction materials in South Korea. It offers pavement, bulk, and slag cement; ready-mixed-concrete; and dry mortar. The company also operates theme parks and skyranch farms; and trades various resources products, such as coal, oil, and natural gas, as well as machinery and components. In addition, it is involved in the logistics business, including freight transport and loading services; and corporate venture capital, consignment, livestock, insurance agency, finance, real estate rental, video production, liquor wholesale, and beer production business. The company was founded in 1961 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"한일홀딩스(주)는 자회사와 함께 한국에서 건축자재를 제조 및 판매하고 있습니다. 포장, 벌크 및 슬래그 시멘트를 제공합니다. 레디믹스트 콘크리트; 그리고 마른 모르타르. 이 회사는 테마파크와 하늘목장 농장도 운영하고 있습니다. 석탄, 석유, 천연가스 등 다양한 자원제품과 기계, 부품을 거래하고 있습니다. 또한 화물 운송 및 하역 서비스를 포함한 물류 사업에도 참여하고 있습니다. 기업벤처캐피털, 위탁판매, 축산, 보험대리점, 금융, 부동산 임대, 영상제작, 주류도매, 맥주제조업 등을 운영하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 1961년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 서울에 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"건축자재","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":1965611730060.0,"operating_income":132519181030.0,"net_income":89547927040.0,"eps":2904.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":2363057189350.0,"operating_income":265027026740.0,"net_income":104335286950.0,"eps":3384.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":2248742514